Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,----TEXT-----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  站在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来不就好了  什么时候来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥君
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到藤井君了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚刚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道你会来的话就让他等等了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话就能一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥君来做什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和藤井君…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是  应该是在echoes第一次见面时…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在恋爱上没什么经验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也根本没有想过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己都不明白自己的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也是  那个也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有过那样的事也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在想起来  那都是对藤井君的感情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  从弥生小姐那里拿到由绮的信后让我确信了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撕了扔掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:21.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做还是人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么理奈会…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理奈看过信了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥生小姐说直接转交了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.51,0:03:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥君又说是从理奈这里得知的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥君  理奈  弥生小姐说的都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我越来越不明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越来越爱往奇怪的地方去想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然知道不该去怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这根本毫无关联
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:04:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是却好像能从冬弥君身上闻到弥生小姐香水的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是又觉得冬弥君好像隐瞒了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个人都做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个是真的  哪个又是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗人  骗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都在骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥生小姐  藤井君都在骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想过说不定就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  不能那样想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就像是在背叛理奈和冬弥君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽可能不那样去想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但果然是猜中了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我像之前那样  拜托他做我的助手了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.99,0:04:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才说想拜托的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请再次雇用我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去M3
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤井君他接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  只有那样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经迟了  由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤井君已经接受了我的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想听
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想听！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想把我怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想听…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打我吧  由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的喜欢藤井君的话就不要忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  用那双手…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快松开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快松开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打不了  打不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为理奈也是我最喜欢的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让偶像不惜伤害自己的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有那样的恋爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤井君是由绮最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我却把那个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做个忍气吞声的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有忍气吞声
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远永远永远等下去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来都是这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不回来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使那样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使那样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:07:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到死去  直到从这世界上消失
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全相反呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  和由绮  藤井君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮和藤井君非常相似
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像兄妹一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我不会放弃藤井君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话我也等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也并非被告白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来路途会很漫长
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之就先以眼前的维纳斯为目标
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始努力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮也是  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定不参加维纳斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和绪方先生这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底是为了什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是再说出这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次就是我打你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呐  由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我约好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后我们于公于私都是对手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了打败我而努力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是提议  也不是商量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我做为前辈的最后的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服从吧  由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经这么晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那两人在车里等我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  又道歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要送由绮一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别了  由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东央电视台吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了  马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长  由绮小姐来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥生小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不想回去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能稍微兜一会风吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会影响明天的工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你保证今天再也不哭了  我就陪你去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:11:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人没能振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就没意义吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绪方先生非常生气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的生气的话不会这样就了事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.99,0:11:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  是我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天空出了点时间  去给理奈加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:11:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联系晚了  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理奈很有精神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有虽然有点突然  但我要开始新的打工了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又能给理奈做助手…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  拿画去做担保所以不在手上？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.33,0:12:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我待会儿再打过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  真准时啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天起请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好  虽然我听过了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专辑  不怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零零散散  看不出主题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是小英的极限了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们这里可行不通哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会交给专业的作家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我稍作保留吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:12:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那位是？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫藤井
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的专属助理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不承认
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我用自己的钱雇的  不会给你添麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前那样的任性是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛瑙小姐的…是叫夏子小姐吧  她是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为玛瑙说没有那孩子就唱不出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是特别的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是  没有他的话就唱不出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和事务所没有任何关系  就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意不要引起误会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时也不需要经纪人了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.54,0:13:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  维纳斯是玛瑙出场
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里也注意不要误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么当前我该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:14:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛  现在玛瑙正在录专辑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.43,0:14:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮她和声吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是原来你哥哥的录音室  知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你参加的话将会成为不错的宣传的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.45,0:14:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个全都要加进去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  这半年间绪方理奈的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将我和你所找到的东西  原原本本地录进去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玉匣一样的专辑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能是潘多拉的盒子  你觉得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.17,0:14:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天起要在一起了  请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才是  请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经纪…  你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是负责洞院沙莉衣的室町
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的那张单曲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经决定由玛瑙小姐来写了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从好的意义上来说  我们还是一片空白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以谁的歌都能唱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理奈真是辛苦呢  颜色已经定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是哥哥的歌就唱不了  真辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有那种事  我也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是…未成年吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实从上个月起就二十岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是推广时说是十八岁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢  我记得…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从两年前起就成年了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然已经不是秘密了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我还大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子  沙莉衣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概社长也知道她不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从樱团的时候起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有察觉到的只有她本人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.81,0:16:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  已经察觉到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不听
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说绝不放弃  要单飞出道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某种意义上也许也是非常乐观的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我就只会悲观地注视现实
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是她而是你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的梦想已经实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在内场办了演唱会了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是该对神崎社长说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,职业歌手照现在这个样子对她是没好处的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个似乎就是我们所不懂的大人的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不出口的话  就只有替她加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:16:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来要去打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.12,0:17:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚报和青年报
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的事情很对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉理奈…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.30,0:17:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真慢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是找不到出租车
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在停在下面了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出租车？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过是租车子来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我没有驾照  这种事还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么  应该有签约的公司吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让前台的人问了社长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为租车要花钱  所以好像不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  去把出租车退了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:09.44,up,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}理奈转会的真相  前经纪人独家专访
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  在公会堂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点开始吧  让我听一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么办吧  理奈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难唱的话  改掉也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没说难唱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是旋律的衔接有点让人不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂你在听吗  哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:07.45,up,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs45\fn华康手札体W5-A\bord0.1\fad(200,100)\c&H323233&\pos(404.571,64)\frz35.65}嘎 ——
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.06,up,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fn华康手札体W5-A\bord0.1\fad(200,100)\c&H323233&\pos(577.142,88)\frz43.88}嘎 ——
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.06,up,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs45\fn华康手札体W5-A\bord0.1\fad(200,100)\c&H323233&\frz35.65\pos(72,436.571)}救命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能来一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高潮前合唱的地方  第二小节的第三个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个人变成降调  这还是重做下比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里  也没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得缺少点味道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.59,0:19:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就删掉好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么办
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话我来做和声  再混入合唱里怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:19:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你便吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就好  没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照理奈喜欢的做就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想起来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说在公会堂…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是女神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去演唱会的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花束吗  你是森川由绮的歌迷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.63,0:20:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真意外
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你这样的大人居然也会追星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.67,0:20:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在交往
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.41,0:20:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像骗人的一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  像骗人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  能来听一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.99,0:21:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵的是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮我检查一下么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.93,0:21:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说随你便了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.65,0:21:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了  那我就随便了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.41,0:21:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在住在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊吹町…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绪方先生  为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.99,0:24:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二十页
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.89,0:24:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋爱是盲目的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.83,0:24:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会这样交谈的恋人们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.95,0:24:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是诗人  评论家  哲学家
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,White  Album
